timer_overhead: 2000000 back-to-back clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC) pairs

measurement                             min      p50      p90      p99
---------------------------------- -------- -------- -------- --------
cost of reading the clock twice        22 ns     24 ns     24 ns     25 ns

Any stage reported at or near 24 ns is at the measurement floor: the number
describes the instrumentation, not the work.
